1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,422
Want something right now? Try the ten minute rule.

2
00:00:04,772 --> 00:00:10,400
When a craving hits, don't say no. Just say, not yet. Then set a timer for ten minutes.

3
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:18,338
Cravings rise like a wave, peak, and then fade. Often, ten minutes is enough for the urge to drop.

4
00:00:19,588 --> 00:00:24,248
While you wait, do something else. Drink some water, take a walk, or tidy up.

5
00:00:25,498 --> 00:00:31,792
When the timer ends, decide again. If you still want it, that's okay. But a lot of the time, you won't.

6
00:00:33,142 --> 00:00:36,940
What will you use the ten minute rule on first? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:41,482
Follow me for more delayed gratification tips.

